<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HAYES WHEELS STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HAYES WHEELS STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Jack Kirnan  initiated coverage of Hayes Wheels International Inc with a buy rating  and a 12-month price target of $36.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 3/4 at 31-3/4.</p>
</text>
